      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just dont really want to go to the doctor right now if i dont have to. i feel like i'm just being paranoid and it's probably just my heart rate being weird cuz i haven't exercised in forever. like, if i just take some magnesium and stay on the couch for another week, do u think that would be enough to help it settle down? or is there like a specific supplement that helps with that post-flu exhaustion?",
